        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "就 + limited quantity or focused predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "就 can restrict a quantity to only the named amount. In this use it sets a small limit rather than linking a consequence.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我就有三本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ jiù yǒu sān běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I have only three books.",
                "audio": "a92570278b5efeb5611af4c60ec1f644f16dd41c79b568a706834bd6c61d3a0e"
              },
              {
                "text": "今天就来了两个人。",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān jiù lái le liǎng gè rén 。",
                "meaning": "Only two people came today.",
                "audio": "ede2872bd5f17f25acd6f9209334dce1ef850eef18f401e9eff7d2bd8d379ca8"
              }
